      <h2>6. Post-arrival cost composition at Hamad Port</h2>
      <p>
        The verified snapshot quantifies the statutory 5% duty and the no-general-VAT position, but it
        does not publish Hamad destination THC, brokerage, demurrage or inland trucking amounts. Treat
        the operational lines as LOW confidence and request an itemised fee schedule before booking.
      </p>

      <DataTable
        columns={[
          { key: 'item', label: 'Cost component' },
